# Throughout the course uncommitted files
Trainer-Prep-Guide.md

# Solutions stay unreleased by default. Exception: notebook solution 1
# (Bronze ingestion) is released to git — everything else in both
# solutions/ folders stays out until you decide to release it.
# (Deliberately NOT a bare "solutions/" pattern: that ignores the whole
# directory and a directory-level ignore can't be negated file-by-file —
# "dir/*" ignores its contents instead, which the "!" line below can override.)
notebooks/solutions/*
!notebooks/solutions/01_bronze_ingestion_SOLUTION.py
!notebooks/solutions/02_etl_style_transform_SOLUTION.py
dbt_project/solutions/*